 ial intelligence. Two creators are selected for a two-month exploratory re
 sidency in 2028.\n\nOrganisation: Villa Albertine (Embassy of France in th
 e United States)\nLocation: A single US city or territory chosen by the ap
 plicant. Open to any nationality and to French and non-French speakers\, b
 ut every application needs a letter of support from a partner organisation
